4
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:12,010
That's right.

5
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:20,360
Thai food is one of the most popular types of food around the world especially because of that specific Asian taste it has.

6
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:29,960
