205
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:37,640
These are very special dishes that are important for that country.

206
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:37,810
That's right.

207
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:39,810
So we have our national dishes.

208
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:44,950
And after we finish dinner, we ate so much that we say, I'm stuffed.

209
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:46,420
I'm stuffed.

210
00:09:47,060 --> 00:09:51,800
Now this is a common phrase that you will hear at the end of a meal when you've eaten and eaten and eaten.

211
